---
import "../style.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050505" />
  <meta name="description" content="avokado mini R5, a self-contained RockstarOS spatial computer concept targeting a deployed height of 200 mm or less." />
  <title>avokado mini R5 — One self-contained spatial computer</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <script src="../main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="r5-product-page">
  <a class="skip" href="#product">Skip to product</a>
  <header class="site-header product-header">
    <a class="brand avokado-brand" href="/"><img class="avokado-brand-icon" src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />avokado</a>
    <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#highlights">Product</a><a href="#design">Design</a><a href="#product">R5</a><a href="#os">RockstarOS</a><a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a></nav>
    <div class="header-actions"><details class="mobile-menu"><summary>Menu</summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="#highlights">Product</a><a href="#design">Design</a><a href="#product">R5</a><a href="#os">RockstarOS</a><a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a></nav></details><a class="header-cta" href="#status">Status <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="film-hero" aria-labelledby="film-title">
      <span class="hero-word" aria-hidden="true">mini</span>
      <img class="film-hero-device" src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="Concept render of a single silver cylindrical avokado mini R5" fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="hero-bottom"><div class="hero-product-lockup"><span>AVOKADO MINI / R5</span><h1 id="film-title">avokado mini</h1></div><p>Autonomous alone.<br />Expandable with another mini.</p></div>
      <p class="film-disclaimer">R5 design concept. Not a photograph of production hardware.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="hero-statement" aria-labelledby="statement-title"><p class="eyebrow">AVOKADO MINI / R5 CURRENT BASELINE</p><h2 id="statement-title">One unit.<br />The room comes alive.</h2><div class="statement-bottom"><p>Input, local compute, play, storage, voice, and safe shutdown in one unit.<br />Add the same mini only when the space needs to grow.</p><div><span>≤ 200 MM / 1 UNIT AUTONOMOUS</span><a href="#highlights">Explore the concept <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section id="highlights" class="highlights" aria-labelledby="highlights-title"><div class="highlights-head"><h2 id="highlights-title">Highlights.</h2><div class="gallery-controls"><button id="gallery-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous highlight">←</button><button id="gallery-next" type="button" aria-label="Next highlight">→</button></div></div><div class="highlight-gallery" id="highlight-gallery" aria-label="avokado mini R5 highlights">
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-sensor"><img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="Studio concept render of avokado mini R5 against a black background" loading="lazy" /><div><span>01 / SINGLE UNIT</span><h3>Autonomous.<br />On its own.</h3><p>Input, compute, power, safety, voice, and communications are integrated without requiring an external hub.</p></div></article>
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-height"><img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="avokado mini R5 enclosure concept targeting a height of 200 mm or less" loading="lazy" /><div><span>02 / ≤ 200 MM</span><h3>Small enclosure.<br />Serious validation.</h3><p>The deployed-height target is 200 mm or less. Display, precision 3D input, thermal behavior, power, and final packaging remain unverified in hardware.</p></div></article>
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-base"><img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="avokado mini R5 concept render with a circular pedestal" loading="lazy" /><div><span>03 / SAME-MINI SCALE</span><h3>The same mini.<br />Only when needed.</h3><p>R5 expands a space by adding the same mini, not by requiring a separate hub.</p></div></article>
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-os"><img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="avokado mini R5 concept integrating RockstarOS" loading="lazy" /><div><span>04 / ROCKSTAROS</span><h3>Play locally.<br />Stay within permission.</h3><p>Games, voice, storage, and approved AI connections share one foundation. Nothing is sent, purchased, or published without user approval.</p></div></article>
    </div><div class="highlight-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a highlight"><button class="is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-highlight="0">Autonomous</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-highlight="1">200 mm</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-highlight="2">Same mini</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-highlight="3">RockstarOS</button></div><p class="gallery-hint">Swipe to explore <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span></p></section>
    <section id="design" class="design-intro" aria-labelledby="design-title"><p class="eyebrow">DESIGN / R5</p><h2 id="design-title">Many roles.<br />One compact enclosure.</h2><p>The approved black-and-silver visual language stays intact.<br />Scroll through the current R5 design baseline.</p></section>
    <section id="product" class="story" aria-labelledby="product-title">
      <div class="story-sticky">
        <span class="story-word" id="story-word" aria-hidden="true">R5</span><div class="story-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="story-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="is-active"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="feature-beats">
          <article class="feature-beat is-active" data-beat="intro" aria-hidden="false"><p class="eyebrow">R5 / SINGLE AUTONOMOUS UNIT</p><h2 id="product-title">avokado mini</h2><p class="feature-headline">One mini.<br />One complete system.</p><p class="feature-description">The baseline integrates input, compute, power, safety, voice, and communications in one unit. R5 does not inherit the old E3 configuration of four towers plus a separate hub.</p><span class="feature-meta">CURRENT BASELINE / CONCEPT RENDERING / NOT PRODUCTION HARDWARE</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="sensor" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">01 / PRECISION 3D INPUT</p><h2>Turn space<br />into input.</h2><p class="feature-description">The research goal is to treat body and object movement as precision 3D input. Method, latency, tracking range, and false-input rate remain unverified in hardware.</p><div class="sensor-capabilities"><div><span>DESIGN GOAL</span><strong>Spatial input</strong><p>Low-latency input for play, creation, and learning.</p></div><div><span>NOT VERIFIED</span><strong>0 hardware tests</strong><p>The sensor method and performance are not final.</p></div></div><span class="feature-meta">CONCEPT GOAL — NOT A DEMONSTRATED SENSOR OUTPUT</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="telescope" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">02 / PRODUCT ENVELOPE</p><h2>Within 200 mm.<br />Packaging comes next.</h2><p class="feature-description">The deployed-height target is 200 mm or less. Safe packaging of the display, compute, power, thermal, voice, and communications systems has not passed validation.</p><span class="feature-meta">TARGET ≤ 200 MM / FINAL PACKAGING NOT VERIFIED</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="base" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">03 / SAME-MINI SCALE OUT</p><h2>To expand,<br />add the same mini.</h2><p class="feature-description">First prove one unit works on its own. Add the same mini only as needed. R5 will not return to a required dedicated external hub.</p><span class="feature-meta">ONE UNIT FIRST / MULTI-UNIT COORDINATION NOT VERIFIED</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="os" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">04 / ROCKSTAROS</p><h2>Play. Create.<br />Respect permission.</h2><p class="feature-description">The OS foundation brings together local games, voice, storage, and approved AI connections. Enclosure integration and acceptance on R5 hardware are not complete.</p><span class="feature-meta">NO UNAPPROVED CAPTURE, PAYMENT, PUBLISHING, OR SAFETY OVERRIDE</span></article>
        </div>
        <div class="stage" id="stage"><div class="motion-product" id="motion-product" role="img" aria-label="Single-unit avokado mini R5 concept render. Scroll to move through the design priorities."><span class="camera-sweep" aria-hidden="true"></span><img class="turn-frame" data-view="front" src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="" fetchpriority="high" /><img class="turn-frame" data-view="side" src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="" /><img class="turn-frame" data-view="rear" src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="" /><span class="camera-flare camera-flare-upper" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="sensor-closeup" id="sensor-closeup" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="" /><div><span><i></i> R5 · DESIGN GOAL</span><span><i></i> HARDWARE · NOT VERIFIED</span></div></div></div>
        <div class="sensor-gaze" id="sensor-gaze" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sensor-gaze-upper"></span></div>
        <div class="story-foot"><div><span id="chapter">INTRO / R5</span><strong id="angle">R5</strong></div><div class="track"><div id="progress"></div></div><span class="scroll-note">SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span></div>
        <div class="price-panel" id="price-panel" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT STATUS / R5</p><h2>avokado mini</h2><div class="price"><span>Price, release date, and sales terms</span><strong>Not yet set</strong><small>Basic design stage · 0 hardware tests</small></div><div class="price-actions"><span class="price-availability">Reservations and checkout are closed</span><a class="text-link" href="/preorder/" tabindex="-1" id="preorder-link">View sales status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="fine">The old E3 product configuration and pricing do not apply to R5. Manufacturing approval, final specifications, and shipping terms are not yet set.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="status" class="os-install" aria-labelledby="os-install-title"><div class="os-install-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="os-install-content"><h2 id="os-install-title">RockstarOS</h2><a class="os-install-button" href="/install/"><span class="os-install-button-sensor" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span><span class="os-install-button-copy"><strong>View release status</strong><small>ROCKSTAROS / CURRENT STATUS</small></span><span class="os-install-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer><span>© 2026 avokadinc</span><a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a><a href="/legal/">Sales terms</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock">GitHub ↗</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
